# ControlDeck Project Rules

## Architecture Highlights
- `src/`: Svelte 5 desktop interface and `src/mobile/` companion controller.
- `src-tauri/src/`: Rust backend implementing input mapping, window detection, and WebSocket server.
- `src-tauri/src/server/dist-mobile/`: Embedded distribution of PocketPad mobile web app.

## Token Optimization Best Practices
- Never dump whole files into context.
- Use `justless` or MCP graph tools (`search_graph`, `trace_path`) for targeted inspection.
- Build frontend with `npm run build` before packaging Tauri.
